<%- include('partials/header') %>
<section class="hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">A refugee school in Turkana County</span><h1>Every learner deserves room to <em>grow.</em></h1><p class="hero-copy">Kaloboyei School is a place for curious minds, brave questions and the steady work of building a hopeful future together.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/about">Meet our school <span>↗</span></a><a class="arrow-link" href="/donate">Help a learner <span>↗</span></a></div></div><div class="hero-visual"><img class="hero-image" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509062522246-3755977927d7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85" alt="Students learning together in a bright classroom"><div class="hero-note">Learning changes everything<small>Our community makes sure no learner walks alone.</small></div></div></section>
<section class="stats"><div class="stat"><strong>420</strong><span>learners finding their path</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>28</strong><span>teachers and support staff</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>12</strong><span>years growing together</span></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="split"><img class="feature-image" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544717305-2782549b5136?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85" alt="Student smiling outside school"><div><span class="kicker">More than a classroom</span><h2>School should feel like a beginning.</h2><p class="body-copy">At Kaloboyei, we create a safe, welcoming place where refugee and host-community learners can learn with confidence. We care about strong academics, but also about friendship, creativity, practical skills and the freedom to imagine a life beyond today.</p><div class="link-row"><a class="arrow-link" href="/about">Our story <span>↗</span></a><a class="arrow-link" href="/gallery">See school life <span>↗</span></a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section events-preview"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="kicker">On the calendar</span><h2>Small moments, shared widely.</h2></div><a class="arrow-link" href="/events">View all events <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="event-list"><% events.slice(0, 3).forEach(event => { %><a class="event-item" href="/events"><div class="event-date"><%= event.date %><small><%= event.month %></small></div><div><h3><%= event.title %></h3><p><%= event.detail %></p></div><span class="tag"><%= event.tag %></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><% }) %></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="kicker">From our community</span><h2>There is a lot to celebrate.</h2></div><a class="arrow-link" href="/gallery">Open gallery <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="gallery-grid"><% gallery.slice(0, 3).forEach(item => { %><figure class="gallery-card"><img src="<%= item.image %>" alt="<%= item.title %>"><figcaption><small><%= item.category %></small><%= item.title %></figcaption></figure><% }) %></div></section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
